### Checked and correct

- **`checks.mjs`: 180/180 passed.** AUDIT-E, the 15 Phase 3 routes, 320, 390 and 844×390, 100 and 200%, Chromium and WebKit, on port 60059. It checks overflow, the text floor, touch targets, CLS and console errors. Results: `/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-josek0514-Desktop-NEVORA-UI-READINESS/8c7acfe8-4195-49cb-a26a-ba2ac9ec5c59/scratchpad/main/checks/2026-10-19T19-56-06-087Z.json`. It can't see text cut or overlapped inside a card, which is why P3-WR-16 to 18 pass it.
- **No sideways scroll** (`scrollWidth` = viewport) on all 15 Employee and Lead pages at 320, 360, 390, 430 and 844×390, at 100, 125, 150 and 200%:
  - AUDIT-E at every width.
  - AUDIT-LEAD at 320, 390 and landscape.
  - AUDIT-LONG at 320.
