- **Landscape:** phone shell everywhere. No sidebar, 68px header, tab bar, titles 30/36.
- **Employee vs Lead:** the same page heights and parts on My time, Timecards, Home and Requests. The only differences are data.
- **More sheet** (Employee, Lead, Manager, Owner at 320 and 844×390, 100 and 200%): no text leaves the sheet. Close (288×48, 53 at 200%) stays at y=775–828 after scrolling the list to the bottom. Nothing is hidden under it at the end of the scroll. Long names wrap: "Alexandra Rivera" on 3 lines at 320/200%.
- **Loading placeholders** (AUDIT-E 12 routes at 320/200% and 3 in landscape; AUDIT-M Home, Inbox, Schedule, Team, Timecards, Time exports and the single review; QAOWNER Home and Payroll): every part sits inside 16–304 at 320, with no sideways scroll and no sidebar in landscape. The single time-off review shows no section tabs from the first frame. Exception: Home's landscape band height (P3-WR-13).
- **Header Search:** at 150/200% the word is now visually hidden on phones (`portal-premium.css:1413`). The coordinator's round-3 item is closed.
- **Long name:** "María José Rivera Santiago With A Long Name" wraps on Profile and in the More sheet. Nothing is cut at 320/200%.

